      "content": "It takes immense courage to articulate how exhausted you are from carrying this weight, and I hear how much the struggle feels pointless right now. However, the profound pain you are feeling does not have to be your last chapter. Please reach out to a crisis hotline or emergency services immediately—they are trained to sit with this immense heaviness with you. Connecting with them right now is the first step toward finding a path away from this darkness.",
